    <div class="eyebrow">About us</div>
    <h1>Buy less regret. Find better products.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Buy Better Finds is an independent product-discovery website focused on useful recommendations, comparisons, and buying guidance.</p>
    <p>Our goal is to help shoppers understand what matters before spending their money. Instead of overwhelming you with endless choices, we focus on specific products and practical information that makes comparisons easier.</p>

    <h2>Our editorial approach</h2>
    <p>We research specific products, consider intended use and practical features, explain meaningful tradeoffs, and identify the type of shopper a product may suit best. We aim to add original commentary and analysis rather than simply reproducing retailer descriptions.</p>
    <p>Our editorial selections are made independently. A product is not recommended because it pays us more, and an affiliate relationship does not determine the Buy Better Score.</p>
    <p><a href="/why-we-recommend/">Read our full recommendation methodology →</a></p>
