    <h2>Prices and product information</h2>
    <p>Prices, availability, specifications, promotions, shipping, and return policies can change. Always confirm current information with the retailer or manufacturer before purchasing.</p>

    <h2>Product imagery</h2><p>Product imagery is sourced from manufacturer media resources, authorized press materials, original photography, or other sources where appropriate usage rights are established. For new Daily Deal products, we prioritize verified manufacturer or press/media sources.</p>\n\n    <h2>Review cadence</h2><p>Product pages display a last-reviewed date. When meaningful product changes, availability issues, or new alternatives affect a recommendation, we can revisit the page and update the editorial assessment.</p>\n\n    <h2>Product imagery</h2><p>Product imagery is sourced from manufacturer media resources, authorized press materials, original photography, or other sources where appropriate usage rights are established. For new Daily Deal products, we prioritize verified manufacturer or press/media sources.</p>\n\n    <h2>Review cadence</h2><p>Product pages display a last-reviewed date. When meaningful product changes, availability issues, or new alternatives affect a recommendation, we can revisit the page and update the editorial assessment.</p>\n\n    <h2>Our promise</h2>
